    "description": {
      "content": "The Bifrost HTTP Gateway API provides an OpenAI-compatible RESTful interface that routes requests to any of 20+ supported AI providers through a single unified endpoint. Requests specify the provider and model using the format provider/model-name in the model field, enabling seamless provider switching without client code changes.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Bifrost Community",
